{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object nearby, take it and perform a task, else move to location. Scan always. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObject    /> <SubTree ID = PerformTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ScanEnvironment    /> <Action ID = MoveToLocation    />\"",
